{"asset_key":"ep5/quest_story_15103470","episode":"ep5","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15103470","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1510347001:0":{"text":"なぜ、ここに……？","source_cn":"是你们？你们怎么……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x00070040B977F6CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510347002:0":{"text":"異変が起きていると気付いて駆けつけました。一体何があったのです？","source_cn":"珀尔修斯，我们知道营地出事了，这是怎么了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DD57C139C3ECC89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510347003:1":{"text":"軍医が調べている。おそらく食中毒だろう。","source_cn":"军医正在检查，可能是食物中毒。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x272CE2C8F53EF23D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1510347004:0":{"text":"ペルセウス様、これは中毒ではありません！こんな症状は見たことがありません！","source_cn":"珀尔修斯统帅，不是中毒！我从来没见过这种症状！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x18B883DF08B36A5C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1510347005:0":{"text":"まるで何ヶ月も絶食していたみたいに痩せ細って……心音を聞いている間も、水漏れした水筒みたいに胸がみるみる萎んでいきます！","source_cn":"他们就像饿了几个月的人那么消瘦，甚至就在我检查心跳的时...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8C6786650B3EBCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","docum